  "prefLabel": "He-W 511.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 511.02 Scope. This part shall apply to all medicaid and children’s health insurance program (CHIP) members. Enrollment in HIPP shall be voluntary for all medicaid recipients.\n\nSource. #10632, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14075, eff 9-20-24, EXPIRES: 9-20-34",
